<view class="page-container">
  <view class="fixed-header">
    <view class="status-bar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"></view>
    
    <view class="header-bar">
      <view class="header-left">
        <view class="back-btn" bindtap="goBack">
          <view class="back-icon"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="header-center">
        <view class="header-title">充值中心</view>
      </view>
      <view class="header-right"></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="header-placeholder" style="height: calc({{statusBarHeight}}px + 112rpx);"></view>
  
  <view class="page-content">
  
  <view class="balance-card">
    <view class="balance-label">当前余额</view>
    <view class="balance-value">
      <text class="currency">¥</text>
      <text class="amount">{{balance}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="ios-notice" wx:if="{{isIOS}}">
    <view class="notice-icon"></view>
    <text>iOS端充值因苹果平台收取约30%手续费，价格略高于安卓端</text>
  </view>
  
  <view class="limit-section">
    <view class="limit-item">
      <text class="limit-label">单次上限</text>
      <text class="limit-value">¥{{maxSingleAmount}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="limit-item">
      <text class="limit-label">今日已充</text>
      <text class="limit-value">¥{{dailyRecharged}}/{{maxDailyAmount}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="limit-item">
      <text class="limit-label">本月已充</text>
      <text class="limit-value">¥{{monthlyRecharged}}/{{maxMonthlyAmount}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="recharge-section">
    <view class="section-title">选择充值金额</view>
    <view class="recharge-grid">
      <view 
        class="recharge-item {{selectedAmount === item.displayAmount ? 'active' : ''}}" 
        wx:for="{{rechargeOptions}}" 
        wx:key="displayAmount"
        bindtap="selectAmount"
        data-amount="{{item.displayAmount}}"
      >
        <view class="recharge-amount">¥{{item.displayAmount}}</view>
        <view class="recharge-bonus" wx:if="{{item.bonus}}">送¥{{item.bonus}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="agreement-section">
    <view class="agreement-check" bindtap="showAgreementModal">
      <view class="checkbox {{agreedToTerms ? 'checked' : ''}}">
        <view class="check-icon" wx:if="{{agreedToTerms}}"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="agreement-text">我已阅读并同意《用户充值协议》</text>
    </view>
    <view class="agreement-link" bindtap="showAgreementModal">查看协议详情</view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="benefits-section">
    <view class="section-title">充值优惠</view>
    <view class="benefit-item" wx:for="{{benefits}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="benefit-icon"></view>
      <view class="benefit-info">
        <view class="benefit-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="benefit-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="risk-notice">
    <view class="risk-title">⚠️ 重要风险提示</view>
    <view class="risk-content">
      <text>1. 预付充值属于消费预付款，存在商家经营风险，请根据实际消费需求合理充值，不建议大额充值。</text>
      <text>2. 本平台充值余额仅限在本平台合作门店消费使用，不可提现、不可转让。</text>
      <text>3. 如需退款，可在"我的-余额-申请退款"中提交申请，退款将在3-5个工作日内原路返回。</text>
      <text>4. 如发现账户异常，请立即联系客服：400-888-8888</text>
      <text>5. 本平台保留对充值活动的最终解释权。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <view class="recharge-btn {{agreedToTerms ? '' : 'disabled'}}" bindtap="doRecharge">
      <text>立即充值 ¥{{selectedAmount}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="agreement-modal" wx:if="{{showAgreement}}" catchtouchmove="true">
    <view class="modal-mask" bindtap="hideAgreementModal"></view>
    <view class="modal-content">
      <view class="modal-header">
        <text class="modal-title">用户充值协议</text>
        <view class="modal-close" bindtap="hideAgreementModal"></view>
      </view>
      <scroll-view class="modal-body" scroll-y>
        <view class="agreement-content">
          <view class="agreement-section-title">一、服务说明</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">1.1 本充值服务由"一碗好饭"提供，用户可通过微信小程序进行账户充值。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">1.2 充值金额将存入用户账户余额，可用于在"一碗好饭"合作门店消费。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">1.3 余额仅限消费使用，不可提现、不可转让给他人。</text>
          
          <view class="agreement-section-title">二、充值限制</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">2.1 单次充值上限：¥300</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">2.2 单日累计充值上限：¥500</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">2.3 单月累计充值上限：¥1,000</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">2.4 上述限制可根据监管要求进行调整，恕不另行通知。</text>
          
          <view class="agreement-section-title">三、iOS端充值说明</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">3.1 由于苹果App Store政策，iOS端充值需支付约30%的手续费。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">3.2 iOS端充值价格高于安卓端，但到账金额相同。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">3.3 iOS用户可前往门店收银台充值，享受与安卓端相同的价格优惠。</text>
          
          <view class="agreement-section-title">四、退款政策</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.1 用户可申请退还账户余额中的本金部分。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.2 赠送金额不属于用户本金，不可退款。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.3 退款金额计算方式：可退金额 = 剩余余额 × (充值本金 ÷ (充值本金 + 赠送金额))。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.4 示例：充值¥100送¥10，消费¥50后剩余¥60，可退金额 = ¥60 × (100÷110) ≈ ¥54.5。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.5 退款将在3-5个工作日内原路返回至原支付账户。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.6 退款申请路径：我的 → 余额 → 申请退款，或前往门店收银台办理。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">4.7 客服电话：400-888-8888</text>
          
          <view class="agreement-section-title">五、风险提示</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">5.1 预付充值属于消费预付款，存在商家经营风险，请根据实际消费需求合理充值，不建议大额充值。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">5.2 请勿将账户余额用于非消费目的，禁止利用充值进行洗钱、套现等违法违规活动。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">5.3 如发现账户异常交易，请立即联系客服冻结账户。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">5.4 请妥善保管账户信息，因个人原因导致账户被盗用，本平台不承担相关责任。</text>
          
          <view class="agreement-section-title">六、法律声明</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">6.1 本服务受中华人民共和国法律管辖。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">6.2 如有争议，双方应友好协商解决；协商不成的，可向一碗好饭餐饮管理有限公司所在地人民法院提起诉讼。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">6.3 本平台保留对充值活动的最终解释权。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">6.4 本协议自用户点击"同意并继续"按钮之日起生效。</text>
          
          <view class="agreement-section-title">七、特别提醒</view>
          <text class="agreement-text">7.1 请您仔细阅读以上条款，特别是风险提示部分。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">7.2 点击"同意并继续"即表示您已充分理解并同意以上所有条款。</text>
          <text class="agreement-text">7.3 如有疑问，请联系客服：400-888-8888</text>
        </view>
      </scroll-view>
      <view class="modal-footer">
        <view class="agree-btn" bindtap="agreeToTerms">同意并继续</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <login-modal show="{{showLoginModal}}" bind:success="onLoginSuccess" bind:close="onCloseLoginModal" />
</view>
